OL,3,GNEWSATeen arrested after A66 crash
OL,4,Aadmits weapon crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager arrested in the wake of the
OL,7,FA66 crash which killed seven people,
OL,8,Fincluding two police officers, has
OL,9,Fadmitted weapons offences in relation
OL,10,Fto a shooting.
OL,12,FKai Beattie, 19 and from Redcar,
OL,13,Fpleaded guilty at Teesside Crown Court
OL,14,Fto possessing a firearm with intent to
OL,15,Fendanger a life and having a machete.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
