OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeen arrested after A66 crash
OL,4,Aadmits weapon crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeattie's barrister Gary Wood said the
OL,7,Fteenager admitted being present when a
OL,8,Fgun was fired in Grangetown on 22 July,
OL,9,Fbut denied being the shooter.
OL,10,FProsecutor Richard Herrmann said "the
OL,11,FCrown firmly say this young man was the
OL,12,Fshooter of the gun", but his basis of
OL,13,Fplea would be considered.
OL,15,FBeattie was remanded into custody and
OL,16,Fis due to be sentenced on 20 November.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
